that is exactly right,

00:10:58.354 --> 00:10:59.353
and appropriate,

00:10:59.353 --> 00:11:01.109
and everybody comes from
different starting points

00:11:01.109 --> 00:11:04.403
and I have unbelievable empathy to that.

00:11:04.403 --> 00:11:06.310
The exciting thing, though

00:11:06.310 --> 00:11:09.479
is that our grandparents
didn't have this thing.

00:11:09.479 --> 00:11:10.685
They hadda work nine to six,

00:11:10.685 --> 00:11:11.692
nine to seven,

00:11:11.692 --> 00:11:13.392
and then there was only so much upside

00:11:13.392 --> 00:11:15.550
that they could create
for themselves long-term

00:11:15.550 --> 00:11:17.526
from seven to two in the morning.

00:11:17.526 --> 00:11:20.173
This thing has fundamentally
changed everything

00:11:20.173 --> 00:11:22.442
and I just think we take it for granted.

00:11:22.442 --> 00:11:24.351
I really wish everybody understood

00:11:24.351 --> 00:11:25.700
the power that is literally sitting

00:11:25.700 --> 00:11:27.453
in their hands right now.

00:11:27.453 --> 00:11:29.973
This is literally a media creation

00:11:29.973 --> 00:11:31.367
and distribution tool

00:11:31.367 --> 00:11:32.260
that would have cost

00:11:32.260 --> 00:11:33.826
tens of millions of dollars

00:11:33.826 --> 00:11:35.758
if you understand distribution.

00:11:35.758 --> 00:11:37.551
The technology probably cost $20,000,

00:11:37.551 --> 00:11:39.540
you know, 25 years ago.

00:11:39.540 --> 00:11:41.607
Cameras, this, that, fine.

00:11:41.607 --> 00:11:43.804
The distribution?

00:11:43.804 --> 00:11:45.460
You would have had to shoot a satellite

00:11:45.460 --> 00:11:47.107
into space.

00:11:47.107 --> 00:11:49.311
You would have had to
buy a printing press.

00:11:49.311 --> 00:11:51.067
You would have had to buy trucks.

00:11:51.067 --> 00:11:52.974
You would have done so much.

00:11:52.974 --> 00:11:54.881
The fact that every person here

00:11:54.881 --> 00:11:56.915
can literally turn this on themselves,

00:11:56.915 --> 00:11:59.361
create content around something

00:11:59.361 --> 00:12:00.748
they're interested in,

00:12:00.748 --> 00:12:02.496
and then have platforms like

00:12:02.496 --> 00:12:03.812
YouTube, and Facebook, and Instagram,

00:12:03.812 --> 00:12:05.726
and Twitter, and LinkedIn,

00:12:05.726 --> 00:12:07.069
distributed,

00:12:07.069 --> 00:12:08.356
let me remind you,

00:12:08.356 --> 00:12:09.273
at no cost,

00:12:10.342 --> 00:12:12.546
is so batshit crazy

00:12:12.546 --> 00:12:15.522
for all of us old fuckers in here

00:12:15.522 --> 00:12:18.501
that I just wish people would
not take it for granted.

00:12:18.501 --> 00:12:19.334
And so, my friends,

00:12:19.334 --> 00:12:21.604
I come here tonight

00:12:21.604 --> 00:12:23.631
to really try to pull up one move.

00:12:23.631 --> 00:12:25.827
Can I actually take somebody,

00:12:25.827 --> 00:12:27.615
even if they're a huge fan,

00:12:27.615 --> 00:12:29.389
or if they've never heard of me before,

00:12:29.389 --> 00:12:32.330
and tweak their perspective

00:12:32.330 --> 00:12:34.205
