00:12:34.205 --> 00:12:36.713
Can I convince one of you

00:12:36.713 --> 00:12:38.459
that nobody gives a shit

00:12:38.459 --> 00:12:40.340
about your headaches and problems,

00:12:40.340 --> 00:12:41.914
and when you complain,

00:12:41.914 --> 00:12:44.143
you're just taking minutes off the board

00:12:44.143 --> 00:12:45.803
and energy off the board,

00:12:45.803 --> 00:12:47.258
from doing something about it.

00:12:47.258 --> 00:12:49.607
Literally, I am fascinated

00:12:49.607 --> 00:12:52.937
by the inability to be held accountable.

00:12:52.937 --> 00:12:54.296
I'm fascinated

00:12:54.296 --> 00:12:56.024
